{% macro render_summary_pass(summary_pass='', source_scope='') -%}
{% if summary_pass == 'evidence_chunk' %}
## Hierarchical Summary Pass
- Current input scope: {{ source_scope | default('local evidence chunk') }}.
- Summarize only events, states, and unresolved questions actually present in this chunk; do not infer other chunks or the overall ending.
- Preserve character names, event causality, exit states, and evidence boundaries for verification during the final merge.
{% elif summary_pass == 'evidence_merge' %}
## Hierarchical Summary Pass
- Current input scope: {{ source_scope | default('merged result of full-coverage chunks') }}.
- Merge timelines, character changes, and unresolved questions by chunk label; remove duplication without adding facts absent from the chunks.
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
